PageRank Python developments

- PageRank.ipynb: PageRank implementation and some tests
- GraphPR.ipynb: Graph structure devoted to storing node-link data and running PageRank, includes
      - edge weighting
      - hub and authority
      - graph text print (print_graph)
      - graph graphical print (display)

- Libs_PageRank.ipynb: tests of some libraries that come with PageRank
- graph.txt: text file to feed and test PageRank (node_parent,node_child,edge_weight)
